{"unit_id": "tag:01I8:proof", "translation": "第一种证明<PROOFARGEND_0001>由引理<REF_0001>及模（Modules）篇的引理<REF_0002>可知，函子（functor）<MATH_0001>可视为<MATH_0002>，其中用到的是带环空间（ringed spaces）的一个态射（morphism）<MATH_0003>。模（modules）的拉回（pulling back）与张量构造（tensor constructions）可交换（commutes），见模（Modules）篇的引理<REF_0003>和<REF_0004>。态射（morphism）<MATH_0004>是平坦（flat）的，例如，这是因为<MATH_0005>的茎（stalks）都是<MATH_0006>的局部化（localizations）（引理<REF_0005>），因而在<MATH_0007>上平坦（flat）。因此，沿<MATH_0008>的拉回（pullback）与内部同态（internal hom）可交换（commutes），条件是第一个模（module）是有限表示（finitely presented）的，见模（Modules）篇的引理<REF_0006>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "ringed spaces", "target_term": "带环空间"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "pulling back", "target_term": "拉回"}, {"source_term": "tensor constructions", "target_term": "张量构造"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "可交换"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "stalks", "target_term": "茎"}, {"source_term": "localizations", "target_term": "局部化"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回"}, {"source_term": "internal hom", "target_term": "内部同态"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "可交换"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "finitely presented", "target_term": "有限表示"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "引理所在篇名"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "可视为拉回的构造"}, {"source_term": "ringed spaces", "target_term": "带环空间", "context": "该态射的定义域与陪域所属类型"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "给出拉回的带环空间态射"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_