{"unit_id": "tag:01I8:proof-003", "translation": "第（1）部分的第三种证明<PROOFARGEND_0001>对任意<MATH_0001>-模（module）<MATH_0002>，有如下同构（isomorphisms），它们在<MATH_0003>、<MATH_0004>和<MATH_0005>上是函子性的（functorial）：\n<MATH_0006>\n第一个等式（equality）由模（Modules）篇的引理<REF_0001>给出。第二个等式（equality）来自泛性质（universal property），即<MATH_0007>的泛性质，见引理<REF_0002>。第三个等式（equality）由<MATH_0008>的定义成立。第四个等式（equality）来自<MATH_0009>的泛性质（universal property）。第五个等式（equality）由代数（Algebra）篇的引理<REF_0003>给出。最后一个等式（equality）来自<MATH_0010>的泛性质（universal property）。由米田引理（Yoneda lemma）（范畴（Categories）篇的引理<REF_0004>）可得（1）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "functorial", "target_term": "函子性的"}, {"source_term": "equality", "target_term": "等式"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "equality", "target_term": "等式"}, {"source_term": "universal property", "target_term": "泛性质"}, {"source_term": "equality", "target_term": "等式"}, {"source_term": "equality", "target_term": "等式"}, {"source_term": "universal property", "target_term": "泛性质"}, {"source_term": "equality", "target_term": "等式"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "equality", "target_term": "等式"}, {"source_term": "universal property", "target_term": "泛性质"}, {"source_term": "Yoneda lemma", "target_term": "米田引理"}, {"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "同构所涉及的任意给定模"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构", "context": "陈列的函子性同构"}, {"source_term": "functorial", "target_term": "函子性的", "context": "同构关于三个变量的性质"}, {"source_term": "equality", "target_term": "等式", "context": "陈列的第一步"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "第一步所引引理的篇名"}, {"source_term": "equality", "target_term": "等式", "context": "陈列的第二步"}, {"source_term": "universal property", "target_term": "泛性质", "context": "给出第二个等式的性质"}, {"source_term": "equality", "target_term": "等式", "context": "陈列的第三步"}, {"source_term": "equality", "target_term": "等式", "context": "陈列的第四步"}, {"source_term": "universal property", "target_term": "泛性质", "context": "给出第四个等式的性质"}, {"source_term": "equality", "target_term": "等式", "context": "陈列的第五步"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "第五步所引引理的篇名"}, {"source_term": "equality", "target_term": "等式", "context": "陈列的末步"}, {"source_term": "universal property", "target_term": "泛性质", "context": "给出最后一个等式的性质"}, {"source_term": "Yoneda lemma", "target_term": "米田引理", "context": "从函子性同构得出第（1）部分"}, {"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "米田引理所在篇名"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01I9:statement", "translation": "设\n<MATH_0001>、\n<MATH_0002>\n为仿射概形（affine schemes）。设<MATH_0003>为仿射概形（affine schemes）的一个态射（morphism），对应于环映射（ring map）<MATH_0004>（见引理<REF_0001>）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002>有<MATH_0005>，它关于<MATH_0006>-模（module）<MATH_0007>是函子性的（functorially）。\n<STRUCT_0003>有<MATH_0008>，它关于<MATH_0009>-模（module）<MATH_0010>是函子性的（functorially）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "affine schemes", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "affine schemes", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "functorially", "target_term": "函子性的"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "functorially", "target_term": "函子性的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "affine schemes", "target_term": "仿射概形", "context": "两个给定对象的类型"}, {"source_term": "affine schemes", "target_term": "仿射概形", "context": "态射两端的对象类型"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "与环映射对应的态射"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射", "context": "与概形的态射对应"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "第一条结论的变量"}, {"source_term": "functorially", "target_term": "函子性的", "context": "第一条结论关于给定模的性质"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "第二条结论的变量"}, {"source_term": "functorially", "target_term": "函子性的", "context": "第二条结论关于给定模的性质"}], "notes": []}
