{"unit_id": "tag:01I6:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n上面的引理<REF_0001>特别指出，将层（sheaf）<MATH_0001>限制（restrict）到标准仿射开（affine open）子空间（subspace）<MATH_0002>，所得即为<MATH_0003>。从此以后，我们使用这一事实时不再特别说明。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "restrict", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开"}, {"source_term": "subspace", "target_term": "子空间"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "施行限制的对象"}, {"source_term": "restrict", "target_term": "限制", "context": "将给定层限制到开子空间"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开", "context": "限制所取开子空间的性质"}, {"source_term": "subspace", "target_term": "子空间", "context": "限制到的空间"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01IA:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为仿射概形（affine scheme）。设<MATH_0002>为拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的<MATH_0003>-模（module）。则<MATH_0004>同构于（isomorphic）与<MATH_0005>-模（module）<MATH_0006>关联的层（sheaf）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构于"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形", "context": "给定的概形类型"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "对给定模的假设"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "假设中给定的对象类型"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构于", "context": "给定对象与关联层的关系"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "构造关联层所用的代数对象"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "与给定对象同构的关联层"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01IA:proof", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的<MATH_0002>-模（module）。由于每个标准开集（standard open）<MATH_0003>都是拟紧（quasi-compact）的，<MATH_0004>局部拟紧（quasi-compact），即每个点（point）都有一个由拟紧（quasi-compact）邻域（neighbourhoods）组成的基本系（fundamental system），见拓扑（Topology）篇的定义<REF_0001>。因此，由模（Modules）篇的引理<REF_0002>，对每个素理想（prime）<MATH_0005>及其对应的<MATH_0006>，存在一个开邻域（open neighbourhood）<MATH_0007>，使得<MATH_0008>同构于（isomorphic）与某个<MATH_0009>-模（module）<MATH_0010>关联的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）。换句话说，我们得到由具有这一性质的<MATH_0011>组成的开覆盖（covering）。例如，由引理<REF_0003>，可将此覆盖（covering）加细（refine）为标准开覆盖（covering）。于是得到覆盖（covering）<MATH_0012>、<MATH_0013>-模（modules）<MATH_0014>和同构（isomorphisms）\n<MATH_0015>，\n其中用到某个<MATH_0016>-模（module）<MATH_0017>。在交叠（overlaps）处得到同构（isomorphisms）\n<MATH_0018>。\n将它们记为<MATH_0019>。它们显然在三重交叠（triple overlaps）处满足余循环条件（cocycle condition）\n<MATH_0020>。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n回顾一下，开子空间（open subspaces）<MATH_0021>、<MATH_0022>、<MATH_0023>各是仿射概形（affine scheme）。因此，层（sheaves）<MATH_0024>同构于（isomorphic）层（sheaves）<MATH_0025>，见上面的引理<REF_0004>。特别地，有<MATH_0026>等。又由上面的引理<REF_0005>可知，<MATH_0027>对应于唯一的<MATH_0028>-模（module）同构（isomorphism）\n<MATH_0029>，\n即<MATH_0030>在<MATH_0031>上的截面（sections）上的作用。此外，它们还满足如下余循环条件（cocycle condition）：\n<MATH_0032>\n可交换（commutes）（对任意三元组（triple）<MATH_0033>）。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n现在，由代数（Algebra）篇的引理<REF_0006>可知，存在一个<MATH_0034>-模（module）<MATH_0035>，使得<MATH_0036>与态射（morphisms）<MATH_0037>相容（compatible）。考虑<MATH_0038>。到这一步，只需按形式验证即可证明<MATH_0039>同构于（isomorphic）起初给定的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）<MATH_0040>。具体来说，层（sheaves）<MATH_0041>与<MATH_0042>给出两组（sets）彼此同构（isomorphic）的<MATH_0043>-模（modules）层（sheaves）的粘合（glueing）资料，均相对于覆盖（covering）<MATH_0044>，见层（Sheaves）篇第<REF_0007>节，特别是引理<REF_0008>。在当前情形下，具体归结为如下论证。构造一个<MATH_0045>-模映射（module map）\n<MATH_0046>。\n具体地，给定<MATH_0047>，便得到<MATH_0048>，这是由<MATH_0049>的构造给出的。由<MATH_0050>的构造，这对应于一个截面（section）<MATH_0051>。（即<MATH_0052>。）我们断言<MATH_0053>。由<MATH_0054>的构造可知<MATH_0055>，再结合<MATH_0056>的构造即可得出该断言。由<MATH_0057>的层条件（sheaf condition），这组截面（sections）给出唯一的截面（section）<MATH_0058>，它是<MATH_0059>在<MATH_0060>上的。<MATH_0061>是<MATH_0062>-模映射（module map），这留给读者证明。由引理<REF_0009>得到相应的<MATH_0063>-模映射（module map）\n<MATH_0064>。\n按构造，这一映射（map）限制（reduces）后给出同构（isomorphisms）<MATH_0065>，在每个<MATH_0066>上都是如此，因而它是同构（isomorphism）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "standard open", "target_term": "标准开集"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhoods", "target_term": "邻域"}, {"source_term": "fundamental system", "target_term": "基本系"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "prime", "target_term": "素理想"}, {"source_term": "open neighbourhood", "target_term": "开邻域"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构于"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "refine", "target_term": "加细"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "overlaps", "target_term": "交叠"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "triple overlaps", "target_term": "三重交叠"}, {"source_term": "cocycle condition", "target_term": "余循环条件"}, {"source_term": "open subspaces", "target_term": "开子空间"}, {"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构于"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面"}, {"source_term": "cocycle condition", "target_term": "余循环条件"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "可交换"}, {"source_term": "triple", "target_term": "三元组"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "compatible", "target_term": "相容"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构于"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "组"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "glueing", "target_term": "粘合"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "Sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "module map", "target_term": "模映射"}, {"source_term": "section", "target_term": "截面"}, {"source_term": "sheaf condition", "target_term": "层条件"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面"}, {"source_term": "section", "target_term": "截面"}, {"source_term": "module map", "target_term": "模映射"}, {"source_term": "module map", "target_term": "模映射"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "reduces", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "证明开头对给定模的假设"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "给定的层所具有的模结构"}, {"source_term": "standard open", "target_term": "标准开集", "context": "用于推出局部拟紧性的开集"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "各标准开集的性质"},