{"unit_id": "tag:01IB:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为仿射概形（affine scheme）。函子（functors）<MATH_0002>与<MATH_0003>给出互为拟逆（quasi-inverse）的范畴（categories）等价（equivalences）\n<MATH_0004>，\n两端分别是拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的<MATH_0005>-模（modules）的范畴（category）和<MATH_0006>-模（modules）的范畴（category）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "quasi-inverse", "target_term": "拟逆"}, {"source_term": "categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "equivalences", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形", "context": "给定的概形类型"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子", "context": "给出等价的两个构造"}, {"source_term": "quasi-inverse", "target_term": "拟逆", "context": "两个等价的相互关系"}, {"source_term": "categories", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "等价所涉及的对象"}, {"source_term": "equivalences", "target_term": "等价", "context": "两个函子所给出的关系"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "对第一个范畴中各模的条件"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "第一个范畴中的对象类型"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "拟凝聚模所在的范畴"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "第二个范畴中的对象类型"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "另一个模范畴"}], "notes": []}
